xma: XMA2 / WMA Pro decoder

This crate is a Rust port of FFmpeg's libavcodec WMA Pro / XMA decoder
(libavcodec/wmaprodec.c, wmaprodata.h, wma_common.c, sinewin) taken from
FFmpeg commit 76fa18983e3849595fdc332bf9fa583d5fe7a147
(https://git.ffmpeg.org/ffmpeg.git, sparse checkout kept at
D:\xbox-pc-port\emulator\third_party\ffmpeg-src).

